  "description": "A powerful file management dashboard for the Umbraco backoffice (Umbraco 16, 17, 18). Browse, upload, download, edit with Monaco code editor, preview media, rename, delete, extract ZIP, and import files via URL. Includes a Media Cleanup scan that reports unused, broken, duplicate, orphaned and large media files. Role-based access control and zero configuration.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
  "id": "uTPro.Feature.FileManager",
